OL,3,GNEWSAFunding plea for youth groups as
OL,4,Ademand soars
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity which raises funds to support
OL,7,Fclubs and music projects for young
OL,8,Fpeople is pleading for more support.
OL,10,FYouth Music said there had been a big
OL,11,Fincrease in demand for youth
OL,12,Factivities, with more than 33,000
OL,13,Fyoungsters on waiting lists in the UK.
OL,14,FBut it said 37% of the organisations it
OL,15,Ffunded were at risk of closure.
OL,17,FThe government said expanding access to
OL,18,Fmusic and creativity was a vital part
OL,19,Fof the investment it was making in
OL,20,Fyoung people.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
