OL,3,GNEWSAFunding plea for youth groups as
OL,4,Ademand soars
OL,5,
OL,6,FJamming Station, a youth music project
OL,7,Fin Totnes, said before the Covid-19
OL,8,Fpandemic it had 15 youngsters but now
OL,9,Fit had 100. Founder Jacqui Perks said:
OL,10,F"The growth is exponential and we're
OL,11,Falmost struggling to keep up with it at
OL,12,Fthe moment."
